      },
      "lineNbr": 154,
      "author": {
        "id": 1120458
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-09-20T17:24:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "why not a vec of bytes?\n\nalso potentially same thing with the typedef.",
      "range": {
